        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mucopolysaccharide composed of N-acetylglucosamine and glucuronic acid subunits. It is found in the connective tissues of vertebrates. A principal constituent of the extracellular matrix (ECM), it mediates the growth and metastasis of tumour cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>hyaluronic acid</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


